  "description": "Theme-neutral core of the WA.Core Blazor UI: services (forms, views, charts, workflow, files, AI), authentication (login + 2FA), DI setup, component base classes and contracts. Pair it with a theme package (SI.WA.UI.Sneat, SI.WA.UI.960, SI.WA.UI.Aether, SI.WA.UI.SB2).",
